<title>USA: MGIC Investment votes split, boosts payout.</title>
<headline>MGIC Investment votes split, boosts payout.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>MGIC Investment Corp said Thursday its directors voted a two-for-one stock split be paid June 2, 1997 to shareholders of record on May 19, 1997.</p>
<p>Following the stock split, the company will have about 118 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The financial services company also said its directors approved a 25 percent increase in the quarterly cash dividend to $0.05 a share from $0.04 before giving effect to the two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The cash dividend is payable June 2, 1997, to shareholders of record at the close of business on May 19, 1997.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
